  "slug": "two-hours-of-life-changing",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/2637_two-hours-of-life-changing.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "At a class reunion, one former classmate caught everyone’s attention because he had become very successful in his career. But as they remembered him, he had never been an outstanding student. His grades and abilities had been fairly average.",
    "Later, someone asked him, “What’s the secret to your success?” He replied, “There’s really no secret. I just spent most of my time on one thing.”",
    "It turned out that after graduating from college, he had set aside two hours every day to study business management. A few years later, he started his own company. With all the knowledge he had gained, his company quickly grew larger and larger."
  ],
  "english_full": "At a class reunion, one former classmate caught everyone’s attention because he had become very successful in his career. But as they remembered him, he had never been an outstanding student. His grades and abilities had been fairly average.\n\nLater, someone asked him, “What’s the secret to your success?” He replied, “There’s really no secret. I just spent most of my time on one thing.”\n\nIt turned out that after graduating from college, he had set aside two hours every day to study business management. A few years later, he started his own company. With all the knowledge he had gained, his company quickly grew larger and larger.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "На воссоедине́нии класса о́дин бы́вший однокла́ссник привлёк все́х своим успехом в карье́ре. Но, вспоми́ная о нём, все́ поня́ли, что он никогда́ не был выдаю́щимся студе́нтом. Его́ оценки и спосо́бности бы́ли сре́дними.",
    "По́зже кто́-то спра́шивает у него: «Како́й секрет тво́его успеха?» Он отвечает: «На самом деле, секрета нет. Я прост́о проводи́л больша́я часть своего́ вре́мени за однóй вещью.»",
    "Ока́залось, что после выпу́ска из ко́лледжа он отводи́л два часа ка́ждый день на изуче́ние управле́ния би́знесом. Неско́лько лет спу́стя он основа́л свою́ компа́нию. Благодаря́ всем зна́ниям, которые́ он при́обрёл, его́ компа́ния бы́стро росла и росла."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Na vossoeidinenii klassa odin byvshij odnoklassnik privleko vsekh svoim uspekhom v kar'ere. No, vspominaya o nem, vse ponyali, chto on nikogda ne byl vydaiushchimsia studentom. Ego otsenki i sposobnosti byli srednimi.",
    "Pozzhe kto-to sprashivaet u nego: «Kakoy sekret tvoyoego uspekha?» On otvechaet: «Na samom dele, sekreta net. Ya prosto provodil bol'shaya chast' svoego vremeni za odnoi veshch'yu.»",
    "Okazalos', chto posle vypuska iz kolledzha on otvodil dva chasa kazhdyi den' na izucheniye upravleniya biznesom. Neskol'ko let spustya on osnoval svoyu kompaniyu. Blagodarya vsemm znaniyam, kotorye on priobrel, ego kompaniya bystro rośla i rośla."
  ],
